      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "final-fight:1iqobm2",
          "html": "Take lots of high-healing food, including a full <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/BoB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BoB</a> if possible. Wear the Dragonkin protective charm at all times, and pray against melee during stage 2.",
