          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "final-fight:d87i97",
          "html": "Defeat <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Abomination\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abomination</a> in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Brimhaven_Dungeon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Brimhaven Dungeon</a> in the tunnel found in the south-west corner where <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Steel_dragon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">steel dragons</a> are.",
          "text": "Defeat Abomination in the Brimhaven Dungeon in the tunnel found in the south-west corner where steel dragons are.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Stage 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "final-fight:1pzrjry",
          "html": "Focus on mining the 4 pillars in the room while avoiding his attacks. <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Surge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Surge</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Double_surge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">double surge</a>, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bladed_dive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bladed dive</a> can be useful in avoiding damage from the Abomination&#39;s rotating beam of fire.",
          "text": "Focus on mining the 4 pillars in the room while avoiding his attacks. Surge, double surge, and bladed dive can be useful in avoiding damage from the Abomination's rotating beam of fire.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "final-fight:1pzrjry:17n1o5b",
              "html": "His charge attacks are often not aimed at the player, meaning you don&#39;t always need to move.",
              "text": "His charge attacks are often not aimed at the player, meaning you don't always need to move.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "final-fight:nbp81b",
          "html": "When a pillar cannot be mined any more, lure a fireball attack into the pillar. Click the water pool if you get hit to cool off.",
          "text": "When a pillar cannot be mined any more, lure a fireball attack into the pillar. Click the water pool if you get hit to cool off.",
          "dialogue": [],
